                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "SixNails does it again with a sequel to an amazing casual puzzle game of the original EXIT which launched on Steam last December.  The original EXIT scored an impressive 85% score from me and was really only knocked down that low because when it first launched, the price tag as $11.99 USD and the game had 50 levels.  Since then, the developers have LISTENED to my feedback and review, and doubled the levels offered, and reduced the price to just $3.99 USD!  WOW!\n\nAnd now we get more of this amazing challenging game set to a very appealing casual game that will stretch your mind and make you think outside the box!  60 more levels for under $3?!?  No brainer!  This game is so under appreicated here on Steam in my eyes, that I am even offering a huge bundle of highly praised Steam games of all types for buying this game and showing me how to beat the first ten levels of this game!  Check out my first impressions, Competition, and Review video right HERE:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fnurlNy57Ko&feature=youtu.be\n\nThis game is about as good of a casual puzzler as you can find on Steam, and offers a 'through-the-roof' value as well!  Exit 2 scores an incredible 93% score from myself and gets my high praise and 'highly recommended\" vote!  \n\nJust Buy it now... and Thank me later!  ;-)\n(In fact, if you don't yet own the original EXIT, I'd highly recommend picking up the bundle of both games at the offered bundle discount)",
